{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>you turned into a worm.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>your boyfriend left you.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>you have to kill him.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'd KILL YOU as a worm is a difficult platformer where you've been turned into a worm and have to navigate the world in order to find and take out your boyfriend. This demo contains the first section of the game for players to experience the pain of being a heartbroken worm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">an open world that you <strong>have</strong> to climb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a worm with a lot of love who needs to climb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 minute of climbing content (if you're good enough)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a lot of easy jumps that you will fail.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">from <strong>dirt</strong> you come</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351540/extras/worming.gif?t=1740668390\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and from <strong>dirt</strong> you will escape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351540/extras/falling-2.gif?t=1740668390\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">but to <strong>dirt</strong> you will always return</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351540/extras/falling.gif?t=1740668390\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3351540?t=1740668390","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.st